/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='position:relative;\r\nz-index:251658240;left:-51px;top:206px;width:1024px;height:208px'><img\r\nwidth=819 height=2 src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAAQCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAEAAAD\/AwIAgAAAAAAAAAJVjI+py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7D4biSJbmiabqyrbuC5MAENB2jd96zu9+D\/wJg8ShsYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9yttwv+isPksbmMPqvT7LW7DXcXAAA7\"><\/span><span lang=EN-US><b>&nbsp;<\/b><\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF PATHOLOGY<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Clinical Utility:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>It is performed for the quantitative\r\ndetection of IFN- y(gamma) in whole blood containing CD4\/CD8 .<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>The interferon-Gamma is released in\r\nplasma by the stimulated white cells (effector T cells). The assay is thus\r\ndependent<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>on host immune status.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Note:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Results of IGRA test can be false\r\nnegative\/positive in:<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Recent contacts of TB exposure (8 - 10\r\nweek false-negative &quot;window&quot; may exist),<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Co-morbid conditions impairing immune\r\nfunction such as HIV infection;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Immunosuppressive drugs (corticosteroids,\r\nTNF-alpha antagonists) ,<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Organ transplantation;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Haematolymphoid malignancies,<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Carcinoma in head, neck, or lung;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Diabetes;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Silicosis and<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Chronic renal failure.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>.Interference in result analysis may be\r\nnoted in case of administration of any vaccine in past month, infection in the\r\npast<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>month, such as\r\ninfluenza, measles, or pneumonia<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Disclaimer: <\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Due to\r\nlimitations of methodology or immunological specificity and other reasons, the\r\ntest results from different<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>manufacturers\u2019 reagents\r\nfor the same sample may be different, so such results should not directly be\r\ncompared with each other.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>The test must not be\r\nused to diagnose active tuberculosis &amp; positive results must be confirmed\r\nwith further testing for confirmation<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>of latent tuberculosis.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Disclaimer: IGRA cannot\r\ndifferentiate between latent and active TB infection.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\\,Bold\"'>References:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\\,Bold\"'>Pai M, Denkinger CM, Kik SV,\r\nRangaka MX, Zwerling A, Oxlade O, Metcalfe JZ, Cattamanchi A, Dowdy DW, Dheda<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 K, Banaei N. Gamma\r\ninterferon release assays for detection of Mycobacterium tuberculosis\r\ninfection. Clin Microbiol<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Rev. 2014\r\nJan;27(1):3-20. doi: 10.1128\/CMR.00034-13. PMID: 24396134; PMCID: PMC3910908.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u2022 <\/span><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\\,Bold\"'>IGRA NSW health, website,\r\nlast Updated on 17th Jan, 2017.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>NOTE:\r\nDiagnostic test recommended by WHO : Xpert MTB\/RIF (TB PCR Test).<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"148.5pt 40.5pt 72.0pt 31.5pt"}}